<title>USA: Schwab to buy back up to 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Schwab to buy back up to 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charles Schwab Corp said Tuesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 1.5 million shares.</p>
<p>When combined with shares remaining under previous buyback authorizations, the company now has authority to repurchase 1,626,900 shares.</p>
<p>As of the quarter ended September 30, the company had 179.6 million weighted average common and common equivalent shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
